    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "59aa36f15ed6b04c520abda0d0fc03cc2c1277fcd565ec424f0e9718be840570",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そんな屈強の戦士でもある彼女に\n勝負を挑まれた主人公は、\n決して手を抜くわけにはいかなかった。",
      "jp_sha256": "a8c1b704bbc4a82cea2efe9b3c53f70aeb065ffc0df25e4fec077ac5c5b28be0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그런 강인한 전사인 그녀에게\n승부를 신청받은 주인공은\n절대 봐줄 수가 없었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6e3e600c533bfbecc26adcb265ddf175cee64090c2fd9c1dab300ff109620ced:000002_966239188098054423:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そんな屈強の戦士でもある彼女に\n勝負を挑まれた主人公は、\n決して手を抜くわけにはいかなかった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
